{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12156","headline":"酬陶六辞秩归旧居见柬 · 钱起","name":"酬陶六辞秩归旧居见柬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"靖节昔高尚，令孙嗣清徽。\n旧庐云峰下，献岁车骑归。\n去俗因解绶，忆山得采薇。\n田畴春事起，里巷相寻稀。\n渊明醉乘兴，闲门秪掩扉。\n花禽惊曙月，邻女上鸣机。\n毕娶愿已果，养恬志宁违。\n吾当挂朝服，同尔缉荷衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12156.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12156","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}